        "original_id": "2987e981-13e2-563f-9c84-9bbde199b4c0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Steve Winwood, Pelle Almqvist, Todd Sharp, Lindsey Buckingham\n- Songs: \"Got a Hold on Me\"\n- Bands: Fleetwood Mac\n- Roles: musicians, singer-songwriters, guitarists, synthesizer players\n- Topics: music genres\n\nFacts:\n- Steve Winwood was born on 12 May 1948 and is an English musician.\n- Steve Winwood's genres include rock, blue-eyed soul, rhythm and blues, blues rock, pop rock, and jazz.\n- Pelle Almqvist was born on 29 May 1978 and is a Swedish singer and songwriter.\n- Pelle Almqvist is also known as Howlin' Pelle Almqvist.\n- On the song \"Got a Hold on Me,\" Steve Winwood played synthesizers.\n- Todd Sharp was a co-writer of \"Got a Hold on Me\" and played guitar on the track.\n- Lindsey Buckingham, a bandmate of McVie in Fleetwood Mac, played guitar on \"Got a Hold on Me\".",
